# The NIGHT daypart is a midnight-crossing BAND in colloquial clock usage,
# not a uniform +12 PM shift: "la una de la nit" is 01:00, "les deu de la
# nit" is 22:00, twelve is midnight 00:00.  Small hours 1..5 stay AM, evening
# hours 6..11 are PM, twelve is midnight (band-split in resolver _clock_hms).
# AM ceiling follows the madrugada band [00:00, 06:00) transcribed for ca in
# chronologia/dayparts.py; Diccionari de la llengua catalana (DIEC2), s.v.
# "nit" (https://dlc.iec.cat/).
nit
